  "notes": "Orrery 0.15.4\n\nPacks\n- New packs can keep their cards secret. You see a pack's full list once you've opened one, and some cards stay hidden until you pull them.\n- Seasonal packs and Gamble Bunny don't count as a card's release any more.\n- Cards that were never meant for packs, like the Cure Broadcast and Level Modulation Casino cards, are kept out of them.\n\nCards and search\n- Big card text cleanup: hundreds of typos and scan errors fixed, effects numbered properly, and official text restored on cards that come from the game.\n- Des Frog and Des Frogbat are now two separate cards, each with its own art.\n- Search handles dotted names (T.A.D.P.O.L.E.), accents and look-alike letters, and ranks results better.\n- Smart tags, related cards and archetypes are more accurate; some cards that had dropped out of their archetype are back in.\n- Cards with only one art no longer show an extra empty slot. If a print is removed, your copies move to the card's main print.\n\nHome\n- The card showcase rotates quietly, and Card of the Day text no longer gets cut off.",
